---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-brand-50/80 dark:bg-zinc-950 border-t border-brand-100 dark:border-brand-950 mt-auto transition-colors">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 lg:py-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-8 lg:gap-12">
      
      <!-- Brand Description (2 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-4">
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-brand-600 to-rose-400 p-0.5 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center">
            <div class="w-full h-full bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 rounded-[10px] flex items-center justify-center">
              <span class="text-xl">👶</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xl font-display font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white">
            MOMPASI <span class="text-gradient-pink">CLUB</span>
          </span>
        </a>
        
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed max-w-sm">
          Platform edukasi gizi dan resep MPASI terpercaya untuk ibu newborn di Indonesia. Membantu tumbuh kembang optimal anak di masa golden age (1000 Hari Pertama Kehidupan) bebas stunting.
        </p>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-2">
          <a href="https://instagram.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Instagram MOMPASICLUB" class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-brand-200 dark:border-brand-900 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-600 hover:bg-brand-500 hover:text-white transition-colors">
            📸
          </a>
          <a href="https://tiktok.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="TikTok MOMPASICLUB" class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-brand-200 dark:border-brand-900 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-600 hover:bg-brand-500 hover:text-white transition-colors">
            🎵
          </a>
          <a href="https://youtube.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="YouTube MOMPASICLUB" class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-brand-200 dark:border-brand-900 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-600 hover:bg-brand-500 hover:text-white transition-colors">
            ▶️
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Links -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Navigasi Utama</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm">
          <li><a href="/" class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:hover:text-brand-300 transition-colors">Beranda</a></li>
          <li><a href="/panduan-gizi" class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:hover:text-brand-300 transition-colors">Panduan Golden Age</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog" class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:hover:text-brand-300 transition-colors">Artikel & Resep</a></li>
          <li><a href="/about" class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:hover:text-brand-300 transition-colors">Tentang MOMPASICLUB</a></li>
          <li><a href="/kontak" class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:hover:text-brand-300 transition-colors">Kontak & Saran</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Kategori MPASI -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Panduan Usia</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm">
          <li><a href="/blog?tag=MPASI 6 Bulan" class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:hover:text-brand-300 transition-colors">MPASI 6 - 8 Bulan</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog?tag=MPASI 9 Bulan" class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:hover:text-brand-300 transition-colors">MPASI 9 - 11 Bulan</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog?tag=MPASI 12 Bulan" class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:hover:text-brand-300 transition-colors">Makanan Keluarga 12+ Bulan</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog?tag=Anti GTM" class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:hover:text-brand-300 transition-colors">Tips Solusi Anti GTM</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog?tag=BB Booster" class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:hover:text-brand-300 transition-colors">Resep BB Booster</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Disclaimer & CTA -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Informasi Medis</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 p-3.5 rounded-2xl border border-brand-100 dark:border-brand-900">
          ⚠️ Seluruh informasi dan panduan di MOMPASICLUB disusun berdasarkan referensi IDAI & WHO. Konsultasikan dengan dokter spesialis anak untuk kondisi medis khusus.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Copyright -->
    <div class="pt-8 mt-8 border-t border-brand-200/60 dark:border-zinc-800 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
      <p>© {currentYear} MOMPASICLUB. Hak Cipta Dilindungi Undang-Undang.</p>
      <p class="flex items-center gap-1">
        Dibuat dengan cinta <span class="text-brand-500">❤️</span> untuk seluruh Bunda & Buah Hati Indonesia
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
